Package: mitmania
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Dmitry Orlov <orlovdl@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: ca-certificates, systemd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.mitmania.com/
Description: distributed policy and interception proxy
 mitmania is a fail-closed egress, authentication, and HTTP/TLS policy proxy.
 It supports end-to-end TLS splicing as well as certificate-faithful
 interception, per-client rules, broker outcalls, and shared cluster state.
